# Integrate AI Financial Advisor Engine into FinanceFlow (`LLM_pilot_branch`)

Integrate the AI and Machine Learning personal finance advisory capabilities from the reference AI-PFA project into the production-grade Flask `finance_app`, isolated strictly within a new Git branch named **`LLM_pilot_branch`**.

The resulting system upgrades FinanceFlow from a traditional ledger into an intelligent, proactive financial assistant tailored specifically for the Pakistani market (PKR) with real-time overspending alerts, predictive ML forecasting, Pakistani product substitutions, Groq-powered conversational AI, and Kaggle-calibrated financial health scoring.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Dedicated Git Branch Isolation**: All work, file additions, migrations, and commits will occur strictly on branch `LLM_pilot_branch`. The `main` branch will remain untouched.
>
> **Groq API Key**: The chatbot uses Groq's free-tier `llama-3.3-70b-versatile` endpoint. Users can supply their key via environment variable `GROQ_API_KEY` or through the in-app settings drawer. When no key is configured, the assistant provides insightful rule-based financial advice and informs the user how to activate live LLM chat with a free key.
>
> **ML Dependencies**: `scikit-learn`, `pandas`, and `numpy` will be added to `finance_app/requirements.txt` to support the 15-feature `GradientBoostingRegressor` spending forecast engine.

